40. Rolling 7-Day Average

Very common analytics question

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.window import Window
from pyspark.sql.functions import avg

w = Window.orderBy(
"date"
).rowsBetween(-6,0)

df.withColumn(
"rolling_avg",
avg("sales").over(w)
)

SQL:

SELECT *,
AVG(sales)
OVER(
ORDER BY date
ROWS BETWEEN
6 PRECEDING
AND CURRENT ROW
)
FROM sales;
